  "description": "Captures an industrial civilisation ending in real time. Nine hours inside Shenyang's collapsing factory district: workers showering in the plant, waiting for wages that aren't coming, singing karaoke as the furnaces cool. Shot alone on a DV camera; the scale is the argument.\n\nAn orphaned young woman goes to Paris looking for work and love. Working as an au-pair, she is discovered by a fashion photographer and becomes a model. She falls in love with an architect but leaves him to marry a rich man.",
